    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, design, and share \u2014 brick by brick.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble beautiful sets and unlock new designs in <strong>Story Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends and build together in <strong>real-time multiplayer</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination run wild in <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> \u2014 design your own builds, create step-by-step instructions, and upload your creations to the Steam Workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse and download  community creations on the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your collection by importing <strong>custom bricks and stickers</strong> to make your builds truly unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're following instructions or building from scratch, every brick clicks into place.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, design, and share \u2014 brick by brick.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble beautiful sets and unlock new designs in <strong>Story Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends and build together in <strong>real-time multiplayer</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination run wild in <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> \u2014 design your own builds, create step-by-step instructions, and upload your creations to the Steam Workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse and download  community creations on the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your collection by importing <strong>custom bricks and stickers</strong> to make your builds truly unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're following instructions or building from scratch, every brick clicks into place.</p>",
    "short_description": "Relax and build. Assemble sets brick by brick, design your own masterpieces in total freedom, play online with friends. The world is your brick.",
